*.docx
# Intentional (Derek): Markdown files stay out of git unless added with
# "git add -f <file>". Files already tracked (PROJECT_NOTES.md) stay tracked;
# a tracked .md file that is moved or a new one (docs/*.md) needs "git add -f".
*.md
# Local-only: nothing at runtime uses node_modules (see "Why vendoring" in
# PROJECT_NOTES.md); libraries are vendored into resources/vendor/.
node_modules/
